# The build context is this directory (docker-compose.yml: `build: .`) and the Dockerfile
# runs `COPY . .`, so anything here that is not excluded ships in the image. Without this
# file the host's .env (BREAK_GLASS_TOKEN included) was baked into a layer. check:docker
# holds the .env rule.
**/.env
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
scripts/
